> x86 models
  skl    skylake        Intel Skylake/Kaby/Coffee Lake client core (this host's i5-9400 is one): AVX2, no AVX-512
  skx    skylake-x      Intel Skylake-SP/X server core: AVX-512 F/CD/BW/DQ/VL, two 512-bit FMA units (ports 0+1 fused, 5)
  glc    goldencove     Intel Golden Cove P-core as in Sapphire Rapids: AVX-512 with VBMI, VPOPCNTDQ, BITALG, GFNI
  rpl    raptorlake     Intel Raptor Lake / Alder Lake P-core (Golden Cove/Raptor Cove): Golden Cove costs, AVX-512 fused off; GFNI, VAES and VPCLMULQDQ on xmm/ymm
  zen4   znver4         AMD Zen 4: AVX-512 (VBMI, VPOPCNTDQ, BITALG, GFNI) on 256-bit pipes, 512-bit ops double-pumped
  x86v2  x86-64-v2      generic x86-64-v2 (SSE4.2, POPCNT): the worst of Skylake, Golden Cove and Zen 4 per class
  x86v3  x86-64-v3      generic x86-64-v3 (AVX2, FMA, BMI1/2, LZCNT, MOVBE): the worst of Skylake, Golden Cove and Zen 4
  x86v4  x86-64-v4      generic x86-64-v4 (AVX-512 F/BW/CD/DQ/VL): the worst of Skylake-X, Golden Cove and Zen 4
